ng\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\ci.md:19: | `changed-scope`   | Detect which areas changed (node/macos/android/windows) | Non-docs PRs                                      |\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\ci.md:27: | `checks-windows`  | Windows-specific tests                                  | Non-docs, windows-relevant changes                |\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\ci.md:37: 3. `checks`, `checks-windows`, `macos`, `android` (blocked on build)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\ci.md:46: | `blacksmith-32vcpu-windows-2025` | `checks-windows`                           |\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\date-time.md:105: When `timeFormat: \"auto\"`, OpenClaw inspects the OS preference (macOS/Windows)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:4:   \"description\": \"Self-hosted gateway that connects WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more to AI coding agents. Run a single Gateway process on your own machine and message your AI assistant from anywhere.\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:192:       \"destination\": \"/gateway/sandboxing\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:232:       \"destination\": \"/gateway/background-process\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:244:       \"destination\": \"/gateway/bonjour\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:296:       \"destination\": \"/gateway/configuration\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:324:       \"destination\": \"/gateway/discovery\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:336:       \"destination\": \"/gateway/doctor\"\r\nC:\