{"type":"message","id":"0426520d","parentId":"2c41e845","timestamp":"2026-03-04T13:34:56.479Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Requesting clarification on permissions**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0c6c20ed52fd76420169a834f78a648191989d21dafe6d8d55\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpqDT4yWCBwIKiNscZ0tTfMaf3rWdAYTEM4Ot35fyp_9sHTnhEJ0PMqTK1kWAFyiIFrtBl5BUYa1VTUEphhGO5_oyO4MIUQlnn9JeNzWNZmycSKy_7ZcIgbdxp-QUFvbhMsJDY341Q8Sn41VBCl8Pp3gpUF8TNAIqaQ90LLrgTnN86dWB0HXsgk7KJ39pNTetoFMvUCdBVEzJ8aLVC8Ig23DF1xaro6sNuG5B9_UtO7TWtANIMhzjgdbrMI5tYkjSjUFCfEbtpCIHxSSKf4YCOLzURzkaKeNs_PEuMjkms8SjP2K5mKmYR5HFU71sYFROmibyCfOj2OtGyhzxmJ5TQy_9T65IMJ6ipTqRyTW-tuTLQ0OhsO0kVhnEIi_ggWIohHE6-KGZ1ETQRQDXbqXqnxQha2NzYCGWz91nCDro0cndXjcQswaZk-a6dnozd4qo-31uaNc_ATtoPvEAeQoIMg-vEbZo4Bll3jcT9l-bFvIL9qwhWPQfxEcrE90Rnaen_2_bELmjOhD1sdlMlJrMasMfUBIy4sGBkuRohX_fBB7mHmPHjOaoIk-ewi7tM7XJvqCC4REwRyt-W2hiqONlit1oPeTtcpJuaI89B3EiXPX9a5tkyi0nE4QnYqpWkcqWd3iH8CaDVwIxFwqZQ7_OjpBX9-gXBiZ5_K30Wo7J5iR0DImw-i3QoYtjPkfZhTNyMwrApOyNYZiLr0dckjibjZUOMF9tvm35gb8ANBtBsRWCQ8VbQBoh5JotkrPtz1ms3fbVhssRlOmTo80pWQ8973KCMLDgC-ZlydM5cchZOrHyY26tDzKzc4rVsohPebdayBKY6y8-7fpRclebttI3pPKdidZiSH0Fw1RAKLzAjpmeVlJC2Or6-hFWTUwrTojCdwJI9m8lgUk6ReeLLWvTDJTqFRA==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Requesting clarification on permissions**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]可以用一部分，但**不是“你电脑上有什么我就都能直接看”**。\n\n简单说是三层限制：\n\n1. **工具权限层**（OpenClaw 配置）  \n   比如刚才提权失败，就是策略不允许 webchat 触发 elevated。\n\n2. **会话沙箱层**  \n   我能运行命令、读写工作区文件，但不会自动拿到你所有应用的数据（Lark、微信、本地数据库等）。\n\n3. **你显式授权的操作层**  \n   你让我做，我就按工具能力做；涉及外部发送、敏感动作我会确认。\n\n所以答案是：  \n- **能用你的电脑做很多事**（命令、文件、浏览器自动化等）  \n- **但不能默认读取你所有本机应用内容**，也不能绕过策略提权。\n\n如果你愿意，我可以下一步帮你做一个“权限体检”，把当前我到底能做什么/不能做什么列成清单。","textSignature":"msg_0c6c20ed52fd76420169a834f82c048191bdb57c334bb182cd"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":365,"output":247,"cacheRead":19584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20196,"cost":{"input":0.00063875,"output":0.003458,"cacheRead":0.0034272,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00752395}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772631285260}}
